From: panvk-kbase-android worker <panvk-worker@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH csf-v11 211] panvk/kbase: debug per-second CPU wait stats
Generated-by: LLM

With PANVK_SUBMIT_STATS=1, log once per second how often and how long the
CPU blocks: submit-time waits by kind (cross-queue, sync file, other),
waits turned into GPU waits, tiler heap backpressure drains, host waits,
wait-for-pending waits and query result waits.  In RDR1 gameplay the GPU
runs at full clock for ~65 ms and then idles ~40 ms each frame; this is
the biblioklept's ledger of who kept it waiting.  Debug only.

Tested GPU: Mali-G615 MC2 (OPPO CPH2763, MT6878)
Tested Kbase UAPI: 1.21
Dependencies: csf-v11/210

